</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We also evaluate DFlash in vLLM on Qwen3.5-9B.
<a href="#A1.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ A.4 Results on More Models and vLLM ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ DFlash: Block Diffusion for Flash Speculative Decoding" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 12</span></a> reports throughput and speedup over autoregressive decoding under different concurrency levels.
DFlash achieves strong speedup at low and medium concurrency, while still maintaining throughput gains at high concurrency.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T12" class="ltx_table">
